{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"7a71c1757ffd1afec829c2e11c9e9b9c42d2262a479a215701e5cb67a85f1043","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["监督的资格"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「人若想要得监督的职分，就是羡慕善工。」这话是可信的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["作监督的，必须无可指责，只作一个妇人的丈夫，有节制，自守，端正，乐意接待远人，善于教导；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["不因酒滋事，不打人，只要温和，不争竞，不贪财；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["好好管理自己的家，使儿女凡事端庄顺服",{"noteId":1},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["人若不知道管理自己的家，焉能照管 神的教会呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["初入教的不可作监督，恐怕他自高自大，就落在魔鬼所受的刑罚里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["监督也必须在教外有好名声，恐怕被人毁谤，落在魔鬼的网罗里。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["执事的资格"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["作执事的，也是如此：必须端庄，不一口两舌，不好喝酒，不贪不义之财；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要存清洁的良心，固守真道的奥秘。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["这等人也要先受试验，若没有可责之处，然后叫他们作执事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["女执事",{"noteId":2},"也是如此：必须端庄，不说谗言，有节制，凡事忠心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["执事只要作一个妇人的丈夫，好好管理儿女和自己的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因为善作执事的，自己就得到美好的地步，并且在基督耶稣里的真道上大有胆量。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["敬虔的奥秘"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我指望快到你那里去，所以先将这些事写给你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["倘若我耽延日久，你也可以知道在 神的家中当怎样行。这家就是永生 神的教会，真理的柱石和根基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"大哉，敬虔的奥秘，无人不以为然！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是 神在肉身显现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被圣灵称义","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被天使看见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被传于外邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被世人信服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被接在荣耀里。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：端端庄庄地使儿女顺服","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":4}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女人","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"或译：在灵性称义","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}